[I] Lua based Jabber/XMPP server

[T] Prosody is a server for Jabber/XMPP written in Lua that aims to be easy
[T] to use and light on resources. For developers it provides a flexible
[T] module system to rapidly develop added functionality or prototype new
[T] protocols.

[U] https://prosody.im/

[A] Prosody Authors
